2	 * Universal HTML print utility with iOS Safari support.
3	 *
4	 * iOS Safari bugs when calling window.print() programmatically from a popup
5	 * opened via window.open(). Auto-print does not fire, and the resulting window
6	 * has no visible UI (no print button, no share, no back), trapping the user.
7	 *
8	 * Solution: detect iOS and inject a sticky visible toolbar with buttons the
9	 * user can actually tap (Imprimir/AirPrint, Compartilhar, Fechar). On
10	 * Android/Desktop, keep the existing silent auto-print behavior.
